{
  "name": "meow-restart",
  "version": "0.3.1",
  "description": "喵重启：Web GUI 顶部可拖动的 ⟳ 小按钮——点一下弹出小列表，可选「重启」（强杀后原样拉起，让插件/配置改动立即生效）或「关闭」（强制关闭整个 DeepSeek Harness，不重新打开）。v0.3.0 改用 wscript 助手、全程没有命令行黑窗；v0.3.1 修好「重启后不回来」——助手继承的 ELECTRON_RUN_AS_NODE 会让被拉起的 exe 以 Node 模式空跑退出，现已清干净并带 explorer 兜底",
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "restart",
    "quit",
    "relaunch",
    "one-click",
    "no-console-window",
    "wscript",
    "vbs"
  ],
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/index.js",
    "lib/client.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "build:helper": "node scripts/embed-helper.mjs",
    "selftest": "node scripts/selftest-helper.mjs"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "zhaoyushuo987",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/zhaoyushuo987/meow-restart.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/zhaoyushuo987/meow-restart#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/zhaoyushuo987/meow-restart/issues"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=18"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-settings-plugins"
      ]
    }
  }
}